;
;$VER: Favourites 1.1.6 (24.05.99)
;
;Make a list of 20 of your favourite cartridges in the saved cartridges path.
;Place the names inside this file (favourites.list).
;The correct format is:
;
;[letter (a-t)]. [name (max 31 characters)]
;
;eg.
;
;a. Lisa.GB
;b. Maru.GB
;c. Popo.GB
;
;The amount of entries can range from one to 20.
;
;The names appear in the correct order in the menu list (a is the first,
;t is the last entry).
;
;This format is a very strict one, so make sure the lower case letters begin
;right in the beginning of a new line and there's one space between the
;following dot and the entry name.
;
;Here's the default list.
;
a. Ichi.GB
b. Ni.GB
c. San.GB
d. Yon.GB
e. Go.GB
f. Roku.GB
g. Shichi.GB
h. Hachi.GB
i. Kyuu.GB
j. Juu.GB
k. Juuichi.GB
l. Juuni.GB
m. Juusan.GB
n. Juuyon.GB
o. Juugo.GB
p. Juuroku.GB
q. Juushichi.GB
r. Juuhachi.GB
s. Juukyuu.GB
t. Nijuu.GB
